-- V46 — Parking-Bay Scan: gpNumber's optionsSource used lookupType='gpNumbers'
-- (a GenericEntityController special case filtering on gate_pass.status only).
-- Switch to the declarative POST /api/m0/datasource/query approach (same as
-- V43/V44/V45): entity=GatePass joined to WorkflowInstance, filtered to
-- wi.assigned_role='ParkingSecurity' AND wi.status='OPEN' — this page is
-- reused at every ParkingSecurity-assigned touchpoint across the M10 flows
-- (GATE_PASS_CREATED, QC_PRELOAD_APPROVED, WEIGHMENT_2 all carry
-- assignedRole='ParkingSecurity' per V20__outbound_wave1_closure_numbers.sql),
-- so this correctly surfaces every gate pass currently awaiting a parking
-- scan, regardless of which specific state it's in. No backend code change —
-- DataSourceQueryService already compiles joins/filters generically.
